	// shorten it), and ends at once when its key is revoked or expires, when its person
	// signs it out (`DELETE /v1/me/browser-session`) or ends it
	// (`DELETE /v1/browser-sessions/{session}`, `DELETE /v1/browser-tokens`).
	//
